{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40033","headline":"咏笔二首 二 · 徐夤","name":"咏笔二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君子三归擅一名，秋毫虽细握非轻。\n军书羽檄教谁录，帝命王言待我成。\n势健岂饶淝水阵，锋銛还学历山耕。\n毛乾时有何人润，尽把烧焚恨始平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40033.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40033","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}